<title>SWEDEN: Perstorp repeats forecast for flat year.</title>
<headline>Perstorp repeats forecast for flat year.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish plastics and chemicals company Perstorp AB on Friday repeated its forecast for the 1996/97 financial year that its result would be in line with that of the previous year.</p>
</text>
